editions/monroe-1.3/book-03-no-path-given/state/movement-001/review-cold-prompt.md:2732:# Chapter 8 — Vantage
editions/monroe-1.3/book-03-no-path-given/state/movement-001/review-cold-prompt.md:3032:He made the week's inventory on the last night of the second week, sitting cross-legged on his bed with the binder open across his knees and the lamp turned low.
