editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-003/review-editorial.stdout.log:5150:## What the author owns
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-003/review-editorial.stdout.log:5152:How long Vastin's window runs before the denial; the room is his — nineteen years his at Norhold, no count needed in B6: the paved court, the porter and the pigeons, the cabinet of shallow drawers, the crooked seal-press, the three trays in / held / done; the left hand that dislikes mornings and now evenings (B5 ch5:9, ch50:115, ch58:241) [B5-reconciled 2026-10-06: audit §F.4]; the clerk's single non-work sentence; the order of the cost-landing beats; the visitors' bout partner; Seln's and Cael's conversation (or silence) on the circuit; the texture of the wool exchange's brass grid; how the Hesk letter is read (walking, then aloud).
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-003/review-editorial.stdout.log:5154:## Where we leave pressure
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-003/review-editorial.stdout.log:5159:The seven chapters and all supplied canon are now read. The movement’s main strength is already clear: it turns procedure into escalating pressure without losing character warmth or the physical progression thread. I’m checking exact protected text, line-level locations, source-overlap status, and the few places where the draft may diverge from the ledger before writing the review.
