editions/monroe-1.3/book-03-no-path-given/state/movement-001/review-editorial.md:111:**Progression vocabulary (proxy).** Lexicon = BOOK_MAP §8.1 word list as a case-insensitive regex (fragment(s), notice(s), acquisition/acquired, integration, partial, *-adjacent, deployment, tier(s), rank(s), the five tier names, Iron-equivalent, declaration(s), Arbiter(s), standings, advancement, apprenticeship, toll). Hits: 318 over 36,746 words = **86.5 per 10k** (M1 target ~90); removing the 15 "Iron" tokens that belong to "Iron Skin" gives ~82. By chapter per 10k: 272, 29, 121, 49, 155, 38, 2, 42 — the teaching is front-loaded inside the movement (ch1, ch3, ch5) and D1 (ch7) teaches almost entirely through action. Legal register (classification, classified, schedule, enumeration, enforcement, jurisdiction): 21 hits, 5.7 per 10k, reported separately per §8.1.
