editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/state/movement-007/compiled-prompt.md:370:The found family was the best unit on the floor for two exchanges, on the record, counted. A nineteen-year-old Gold stopped mid-trial to read him. The category that waited three hundred years now has nobody below Gold who will file. Lira's grin: "Then your storm."
