editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/state/movement-007/compiled-prompt.md:1045:- **First third (M1–M3, src 1–6):** teach hard. Tier brackets and seeding by paper. The Standard's architecture, worked at least three times on the page. Exhibition provisions. Registry validation ("adjacent"). Each fragment's cost in the inventory. The band and the variance program. The assay evaluation. Let the reader price ratings before the panel posts them.
