editions/monroe-1.3/book-01-the-shattered/state/movement-005/AUTHOR-REPORT.md:89:5. **Halvern**: about thirty-one, sandy, soft round the middle, ink on his writing hand; registrations, boundaries, permits ("more than six pigs"); a knotted measuring string. **Halden**: thin, grey, a pencil behind each ear, nineteen years in the reading room. *Flag the physical detail.*
