editions/monroe-1.3/book-02-iron-circuit/state/movement-003/pre-repair/chapter-18.md:9:Everything he gave them went in a file somewhere. He had written that on the officials page in his own hand. This was not the Compact, only an old man in a room over a dye works; but a name was a name, and the book was a book, and Cael had been fourteen in a hall with a dark Arbiter over his head and had learned there exactly how long a thing written down could last.
