editions/monroe-1.3/book-02-iron-circuit/state/movement-002/review-editorial.stdout.log:1540:"I'm trying to get as near to the other side as I can from this side." She looked at the floor between her boots. "An Iron Wind gets declarations I'll never be given. I watch them fight. I watch what their steps do that mine don't, and I try to work out from the outside what it is the Arbiter told them on the inside, and then I try to do it without being told." Her mouth turned down at one corner. "Some of it works. Not enough. I can get closer. I can't get there. Every time I get closer I can see better how far it still is."
