editions/monroe-1.3/book-02-iron-circuit/state/movement-002/recheck-r1.stdout.log:1322:# Chapter 9 — Priced
editions/monroe-1.3/book-02-iron-circuit/state/movement-002/recheck-r1.stdout.log:1412:The river-academy man stood at his. Up close he was older than Cael had thought from the benches, nineteen or twenty. He had a long neat face and a long neat body, and the coat was off now and folded square on the end of a bench, with the river academy's grey braid along its cuffs. He held his practice blade low and loose in his right hand, and he did not look at Cael's face or at Cael's hands but at a place on the stone a little in front of Cael and to the left.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-02-iron-circuit/state/movement-002/recheck-r1.stdout.log:1557:# Chapter 10 — Ceiling
editions/monroe-1.3/book-02-iron-circuit/state/movement-002/recheck-r1.stdout.log:1583:"You know how it goes. The ladder. Ten ranks to a tier, and the Arbiter gives you the next one when you've used yourself enough to earn it, and a new declaration with it, a little wider than the last. You've read Joren's. You've got it copied in your old book." She did not wait for him to nod. "And at the top of Copper, at ten, it stops. Not because you've stopped. Because that's where the door is. To go through it you have to be looked at again, properly, by a registered station, the way you were looked at when you were Kindled. And a station won't look at you unless somebody with a name asks it to."
editions/monroe-1.3/book-02-iron-circuit/state/movement-002/recheck-r1.stdout.log:1601:"I'm trying to get as near to the other side as I can from this side." She looked at the floor between her boots. "An Iron Wind gets declarations I'll never be given. I watch them fight. I watch what their steps do that mine don't, and I try to work out from the outside what it is the Arbiter told them on the inside, and then I try to do it without being told." Her mouth turned down at one corner. "Some of it works. Not enough. I can get closer. I can't get there. Every time I get closer I can see better how far it still is."
editions/monroe-1.3/book-02-iron-circuit/state/movement-002/recheck-r1.stdout.log:1820:# Chapter 9 — Priced
