   322	
   323	Nobody had signed for the line. No office was named on it.
   324	
   325	---
   326	
   327	"They will not close it," said Seln.
   328	
   329	He had not yet lain down. He was sitting by the fire with his coat round him and his cup in his hands, and Lira and Karis were awake as well, since nobody had found the way to sleep on the first night of a place. Brom had come back from the lip to warm his hands. So all five of them were there, and the pine was burning with its high clear flame.
   330	
   331	"The file," said Seln. "I have been thinking of it, since I shall not be let stand a watch. A subject who withdraws is closed. A subject who withdraws and then goes where no district runs is a different matter, and there is a line for that; I have copied it on to other people's files, in my time." He turned the cup. "It says *non-compliance*, which is an odd word for a man who has complied with everything. Then it says that the priority of observation is escalated. It is a form. It means that somebody is told to look harder."
