universe/STATE_LEDGER.md:293:**Rival (not roster):** Teague and his crew — the tall woman (spear), the broad man (crossbow; the limp; the leg broken at the Span, knit), the healer of no Path (the older woman with the cloth bag); **the young one DEAD at the pass (Ch21), buried under stone at its east mouth, unnamed (his name said once by the broad man; Cael did not enter it)**. The contract kept to its last line; Teague did not enter the Court; west at dawn on the 308th carrying Cael's letter to Hesk; "Next spring."
