*Spent since the Line: nothing. Not one of the nine.*

*Under all nine, the still place I don'\\''t count.*' 'editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/manuscript/chapter-60.md'" in /Users/drive/fractured-path-monroe13
